With fully secured bio-metric based authentication, the simple and intuitive app offers you peace of mind for your everyday banking activity. It is designed to offer a multitude of functions, from balance inquiry, bill payments to quick transactions. 

Using the BNF Mobile App you can: 
•	keep an eye out and take control of your finances;
•	swiftly view account balances and transactions;
•	transfer money securely between own accounts;
•	make quick payments, pay utility bills and much more;
•	send a secure message to our Customer Care team; and
•	log on a unique security device with your fingerprint or password ID.
Simple and Secure, more control for you!

Transfer money globally, pay online, and more. With Skrill, online transactions are easy, secure, fast, and cheap. The app empowers you to make online payments, and send money to a friend or relative.

• Upgrade your account for free and enjoy special benefits
• Transfer money to India, United Kingdom, France, and more than 180 other countries across the globe; 
• Get a Skrill VISA® Prepaid Card to withdraw cash from thousands of ATMs around the world or make payments everywhere Visa is accepted;
• Load funds to your account via credit or debit card, bank transfer, or local payment methods; 
• Comfortably send money to another Skrill member, a bank account, a mobile wallet, or just an email address;
• Save considerably from transaction costs when transferring money abroad with Skrill’s low and transparent fees;
• Receive real-time notifications for your transactions;
• Enjoy quick and friendly customer support in your language; 

Trusted by millions of people worldwide to make global payments simple, safe, and quick.

